    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d469">

                <pb facs="0602" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg522"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-07-22"><hi rendition="#italic">July 22,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 60.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my dispatch No. 52, of
                    the 5th instant, I have the honor to transmit herewith for your information a
                    copy of a letter which I have just received from Mr. Edwin Gilbertson, British
                    consul at Broussa, which may add somewhat to the evidence which I have placed
                    before the Department relative to the advisability of joint action between
                    British and American consulates throughout the Ottoman Empire.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John G. A.
                    Leishman.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d469-a1.xml" xpointer="d469-a1"/>
